Z||000006||Formula||01-21-2000||10:52 AM||||I have a twin turbocharged, dual exhaust GE fridge with high end sound system.....<P>wait a sec, no I don't.<P>I buy a lot of GE stuff and it never breaks.<BR>Except for the black stereo, hmmmm (sounds like a helicopter now)||||reg||1
Z||000007||deceler8||01-21-2000||12:23 PM||||My fridge is a 1946 International Harvester (yes, IH)...it was given to me 7 years ago...still going strong.<P>The non-frost free fridges will greatly outlast the frost-free ones if defrosting once every six months isn't too much of a hassle for you.||||reg||10
